{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_plan", "label": "eduLLM SSH Session Reliability Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_ensure_master_transition", "label": "ensure_master Session Transition", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "ensure_master probes the alias in batch mode, returns immediately when the master is healthy, best-effort closes a stale master, launches one interactive login, and reverifies in batch mode, so exactly one authentication happens per expired session and the caller never guesses at session state.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_interactive_login_helper", "label": "Interactive Login Helper", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The helper runs the fixed argv ssh -MNf orcd-login with stdin inherited so password and Duo prompts stay visible, sends ordinary stdout/stderr to DEVNULL so diagnostics are never captured, snapshots and restores /dev/tty termios state in finally, and escalates SIGTERM to SIGKILL with a final wait so a hung child is always reaped and terminal echo is never left disabled.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_batch_mode_operations", "label": "BatchMode Remote Operations", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "run_remote() and write_remote() always pass -o BatchMode=yes so an expired master can never start a hidden interactive login inside the bounded 30-second command budget; that budget then measures only the Slurm or file operation.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_sanitized_session_error", "label": "Sanitized SSHSessionError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_service_bootstrap_wiring", "label": "Operator Service Session Bootstrap", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "setup_operator() establishes the master after applying the managed SSH block and before its first remote check, and _load_operator_services() calls ensure_master() once before constructing the Slurm adapters, so setup produces only one password/Duo flow and jobs/run/logs/stop never authenticate mid-query.", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_implementation_plan", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_23_edullm_ssh_session_reliability_design_design", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-23-edullm-ssh-session-reliability-implementation.md", "source_location": null, "weight":